---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <!-- TEMP: hide from search engines until domain is set -->
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
    <title>Technical Writing Portfolio — WIP</title>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-b from-[#EDECF8] to-[#D0D7F2] text-[#162444]">
    <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 text-center">
      <div class="inline-block rounded-2xl bg-white/70 shadow p-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-3">Technical Writing Portfolio - Ewa Jabłońska</h1>
        <p class="mb-6">🚧 This portfolio is still in progress</p>

<Layout title="Technical Writing Portfolio — WIP">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-32">
      
      <header class="mb-16 md:mb-24 text-center">
        <img src="public/Logo.png" alt="Ewa Jabłońska Logo" class="h-48 md:h-64 w-auto mx-auto mb-8" />
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#111112] dark:text-[#EDECF8] tracking-tight mb-4">
          Ewa Jabłońska
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-light text-[#4464AD] dark:text-[#A3B8EE]">
          Technical Writing Portfolio
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="space-y-16 md:space-y-20">
        <section>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#111112] dark:text-[#EDECF8]">Introduction</h2>
            <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-[#D0D7F2] dark:bg-[#434448]"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-lg max-w-2xl text-[#434448] dark:text-[#D0D7F2]">
              I’m a technical writer focused on building documentation systems — not just documents.
            </p>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-lg max-w-2xl text-[#434448] dark:text-[#D0D7F2]">
              My work combines structured content, automation, and process to make documentation scalable, maintainable, and useful in real-world environments.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#111112] dark:text-[#EDECF8]">Portfolio Concept</h2>
            <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-[#D0D7F2] dark:bg-[#434448]"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-lg text-[#434448] dark:text-[#D0D7F2]">
            <p>This portfolio is built as a connected system of four areas:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Content</strong> &ndash; clear, structured documentation (Confluence) and blog posts.</li>
              <li><strong>Process</strong> &ndash; planning and iteration (Jira).</li>
              <li><strong>Code</strong> &ndash; automation and tooling (GitHub).</li>
              <li><strong>Integration</strong> &ndash; connecting tools through APIs.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>The goal is not just to present writing samples, but to show how documentation works as part of a larger ecosystem.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8">
            <img src="public/Audience Engagement Venn Diagram smaller.png" alt="Audience Engagement Venn Diagram" class="max-w-2xl h-auto rounded-xl border border-[#D0D7F2] dark:border-[#434448] shadow-sm" />
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#111112] dark:text-[#EDECF8]">Current Status</h2>
            <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-[#D0D7F2] dark:bg-[#434448]"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-[#D0D7F2]/60 dark:bg-[#4464AD]/30 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-[#4464AD] dark:text-[#A3B8EE] mb-4">
            <span class="mr-2">🚧</span> Work in Progress
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-lg max-w-2xl text-[#434448] dark:text-[#D0D7F2]">
            <p>I’m currently developing this portfolio through a set of parallel, real-world experiments and artifacts, including:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Confluence documentation and structured content for a dedicated use case.</li>
              <li>Confluence-based artifacts exploring documentation design and organization.</li>
              <li>API experiments with accompanying documentation.</li>
              <li>Republishing and refining selected blog content.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>This portfolio is being built iteratively, with each component contributing to a broader documentation system.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#111112] dark:text-[#EDECF8]">Contact</h2>
            <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-[#D0D7F2] dark:bg-[#434448]"></div>
          </div>
          <p class="leading-relaxed text-lg max-w-2xl text-[#434448] dark:text-[#D0D7F2]">
            If you’d like to connect or follow the progress of this project, feel free to reach out on 
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ejablonska" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-medium text-[#4464AD] dark:text-[#A3B8EE] hover:text-[#4498AD] dark:hover:text-[#6BC1D6] underline decoration-[#D0D7F2] dark:decoration-[#434448] hover:decoration-[#4498AD] dark:hover:decoration-[#6BC1D6] underline-offset-4 transition-all duration-200">LinkedIn</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <footer class="mt-24 md:mt-32 pt-8 border-t border-[#D0D7F2] dark:border-[#434448] text-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 text-[#434448] dark:text-[#D0D7F2] opacity-80">
        <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Ewa Jabłońska</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
          <span class="opacity-70">Built with Astro</span>
        </div>
      </footer>

    </main>
</Layout>
